      "id": "claim_64ae31e64a9442cbb541d5b38f8372fe",
      "statement": "The dashboard authenticates browsers via GitHub App OAuth and a HS256 session JWT stored in the osw_session cookie signed with DASHBOARD_JWT_SECRET, valid for 7 days; require_session rejects requests without a valid session cookie and /me returns the signed-in identity plus is_admin.",
